},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n - Reproducible in: v4.7.rc1.official [a4f5e8cdd]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.rc1 - Windows 10 (build 19043) - Single-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon(TM) Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21923.11000) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600GT with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 27.87 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf a shader (`gdshader` file) has a `#define` above the `shader_type` declaration, the shader preview does not recognise its type.\n\n<img width=\"1069\" height=\"443\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e4d01e36-2ff4-4d4c-a8ed-db6dade18d2e\" />\n\nWorks once the `#define` is moved after the `shader_type` declaration:\n\n<img width=\"1066\" height=\"438\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/beb2c226-ffe7-4e23-86f9-3ebd212a4263\" />\n\nThe code that returns the shader type seems to be this: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a4f5e8cdd/servers/rendering/shader_language.cpp#L11359\n\nbut I don't understand it enough to make changes without expecting to break something else along the way. It does look like it's expecting the `shader_type` declaration to be up top, but that's just what it looks like to me.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a shader file that is of a valid type (`shader_type` is `canvasitem` or `spatial` as previewer needs)\n2. Add a `#define` (or likely any preprocessor directive) prior to the `shader_type` declaration\n3. Attempt to preview at `COLOR` inside the fragment shader\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[shader-preview-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28846597/shader-preview-mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120197/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120197/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}